    // or newline is IFS WHITESPACE and a RUN of it is one delimiter, ignored entirely at the
    // ends of the value; any other character of IFS delimits exactly ONE field on its own,
    // so two of them in a row leave an empty field between them. A delimiter is therefore
    // "optional IFS whitespace, then at most one non-whitespace IFS character, then optional
